{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06389","headline":"鲛人歌 · 李颀","name":"鲛人歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲛人潜织水底居，侧身上下随游鱼。\n轻绡文彩不可识，夜夜澄波连月色。\n有时寄宿来城市，海岛青冥无极已。\n泣珠报恩君莫辞，今年相见明年期。\n始知万族无不有，百尺深泉架户牖。\n鸟没空山谁复望，一望云涛堪白首。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}